# Translate: answers of `/phoecord translate` and `/phoecord autotranslate`.
translate-result = { $text }
    -# Translated from { $language }
translate-auto-on = Auto-translate is **on**: your messages are translated before they are sent.
translate-auto-off = Auto-translate is **off**.
translate-auto-failed-title = Message not translated
translate-bad-language = Unknown language `{ $language }`. Use a code like `de` or a name like `German`.
translate-bad-message = Not a message id or link, or no channel to look in.
translate-no-text = That message has no text to translate.
translate-need-text = Give `text` or `message`.
translate-failed = Could not translate: { $error }
